# Environment variables
#
# None are required by this template yet — it's static/demo data throughout.
# When a real one is needed, add it here with a placeholder value (never a
# real secret) so other developers know it exists. Actual values belong in
# `.env.local`, which .gitignore already excludes from version control.
#
# Next.js only exposes variables prefixed `NEXT_PUBLIC_` to the browser;
# everything else stays server-only:
# https://nextjs.org/docs/app/building-your-application/configuring/environment-variables
#
# Example:
# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://api.example.com
